source: tui/src/onboarding/auth.rs
expression: terminal.backend()
---
  Sign in to use Ata as part of your paid plan or connect
  an API key for usage-based billing

> 1. Sign in with ChatGPT
     Usage included with Plus, Pro, Team, and Enterprise plans

  2. Sign in with Device Code
     Sign in from another device with a one-time code

  3. Sign in with Gemini
     Use your Google account with Gemini Code Assist

  4. Configure providers
     Set up API keys for providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini)

  Press Enter to continue
